menu "OpenCharm"

config OPENCHARM_BENCH_FACE
    bool "Show the face without charmd (stage 1 bench)"
    default y
    help
        Until the board connects to charmd (spec 009, stage 2), it plays charmd's hello and
        "unlocked" to the core itself, so the face, the key, touch, the battery and the status
        screen can be checked on the bench. Turned off once the network lands.

endmenu
